{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-039",
    "title": "：记忆洪流"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_247",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "天门写下陆照临三个字之后，天地没有立刻安静。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "最后一盏引路灯照亮通道后，天门下方出现了一条真正的裂口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7122,
          "end": 7122
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "裂口不像门缝，更像天空被人从中间剖开。裂口边缘流动着白色火焰，火焰下方悬着无数姓名牌。姓名牌相互碰撞，发出细密的金属声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7124,
          "end": 7124
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在裂口前，金丹中的青色纹路不断扩张。每一次纹路靠近金丹中心，他便会失去一段记忆。可这一次，失去的不是过去，而是对某种情绪的理解。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7126,
          "end": 7126
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他看见顾长离疲惫地坐在石阶上，却无法理解为什么自己会担心她。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7128,
          "end": 7128
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你在看什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7130,
          "end": 7130
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我在确认自己还认识你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7132,
          "end": 7132
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还认识吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7134,
          "end": 7134
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“认识名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7136,
          "end": 7136
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就够了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7138,
          "end": 7138
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站在裂口另一侧，手里的黑色蜡片已经融化。他看着天门内的灯群，脸色越来越沉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7140,
          "end": 7140
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟的改写台在里面。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7142,
          "end": 7142
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你见过？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7144,
          "end": 7144
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“祖辈留下的地图上见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7146,
          "end": 7146
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻将无相铜镜对准裂口。镜面显示出门内三座石台，分别刻着玄霄宗、顾氏和归墟盟的印记。三座石台中央，是一张空白的白纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7148,
          "end": 7148
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“改写台。”慧闻说，“谁把名字写上去，谁就能决定记忆的归属。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7150,
          "end": 7150
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷声道：“所以归墟盟主想拿到它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7152,
          "end": 7152
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗也想。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7154,
          "end": 7154
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处传来剑鸣。玄霄宗守门派与开门派暂时停战，灰袍修士带着两派弟子共同赶来。为首的开门长老眉心仍留着青色纹路，声音已经半人半灵。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7156,
          "end": 7156
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟开门，三方皆可进入。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7158,
          "end": 7158
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进入之后呢？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7160,
          "end": 7160
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由天门决定谁有资格留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7162,
          "end": 7162
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向他：“他已经被门占了一半。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7164,
          "end": 7164
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老笑了：“占据也是一种归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7166,
          "end": 7166
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老厉声道：“闭嘴！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7168,
          "end": 7168
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两派弟子再次拔剑，却被灰袍修士抬手压住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7170,
          "end": 7170
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7172,
          "end": 7172
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向归墟盟方向。归墟盟主也带人抵达，手中没有武器，只有一卷空白盟约。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7174,
          "end": 7174
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三方都到了。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7176,
          "end": 7176
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想签什么？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7178,
          "end": 7178
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是签，是重写。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7180,
          "end": 7180
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走向裂口。最后一盏引路灯的火焰向他倾斜，照出他黑衣上缝着的数百个名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7182,
          "end": 7182
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这些名字曾经属于谁？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7184,
          "end": 7184
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“属于被删去的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7186,
          "end": 7186
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你把它们缝在自己身上？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7188,
          "end": 7188
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我需要让门相信我记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7190,
          "end": 7190
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得不代表拥有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7192,
          "end": 7192
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以我来取回拥有的权利。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7194,
          "end": 7194
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他将空白盟约投入裂口。白纸没有燃烧，反而在门内展开，露出三列空白：守门、开门、留白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7196,
          "end": 7196
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三条路。”归墟盟主说，“选择一条，天门便会稳定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7198,
          "end": 7198
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价呢？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7200,
          "end": 7200
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“守门，所有被删记忆永远留在门内；开门，人间承担灵脉暴涨；留白，门与人间都不再完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7202,
          "end": 7202
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向最后一列：“留白是什么意思？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7204,
          "end": 7204
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不替任何人决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7206,
          "end": 7206
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻皱眉：“那会造成长期混乱。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7208,
          "end": 7208
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“混乱至少属于活人。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7210,
          "end": 7210
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老忽然冲向改写台。青色纹路从他眉心蔓延到全身，他伸手抓向白纸，纸面却浮出一个陌生名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7212,
          "end": 7212
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7214,
          "end": 7214
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他愣住：“这是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7216,
          "end": 7216
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋从裂口另一侧走来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7218,
          "end": 7218
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她披着雪色斗篷，手里提着已经熄灭的第三盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7220,
          "end": 7220
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是一个曾经替你们点灯的人。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7222,
          "end": 7222
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有人同时听见一个陌生声音：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-099",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7318,
          "end": 7318
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟开门，旧名归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7320,
          "end": 7320
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "改写台中央的空白，终于写下了第一个完整名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7322,
          "end": 7322
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-102",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7324,
          "end": 7324
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "是陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-103",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7326,
          "end": 7326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟开门那日，城中所有井水同时上涨。门后的风带着旧纸和潮土的味道，吹散了三方旗帜。陆照临让众人先把老人和孩子送出，再由自己与陆沉舟入门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-104",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7328,
          "end": 7328
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后来者可以从这里开始，也可以选择另一条路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-105",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7330,
          "end": 7330
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-106",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7332,
          "end": 7332
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟门缝扩大后，门内吹出的风带来不同年代的气味。众人闻到稻草、药香、海盐和烧焦的木头，仿佛许多被删去的地方同时重叠。陆沉舟让每个人选择一种气味记住，作为返回的路标。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-107",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7334,
          "end": 7334
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人将灯册交给城中抄写员继续保存，并约定每次改动都要留下日期和姓名。新的记录不再只写胜负，也写下犹豫、失误以及没有被选择的道路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-108",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7336,
          "end": 7336
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "已记录。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-109",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7338,
          "end": 7338
        }
      }
    ],
